  <para style="h">Hagayi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Igitabu c’uwavugishwa n’Imana Hagayi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hagayi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hag</para>
  <para style="mt2">Igitabu c’uwavugishwa n’Imana</para>
  <para style="mt1">Hagayi</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HAG 1" />
  <para style="s1">Hagayi atera intege abantu ngo bubake Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAG 1:1" />Mu mwaka ugira kabiri umwami Dariyusi ari ku ngoma, ku musi wa mbere w’ukwezi kugira gatandatu, ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryaciye ku wuvugishwa n’Imana Hagayi ribwirwa Zerubabeli mwene Sheyalutiyeli, umukuru w’intara y’i Buyuda, na Yosuwa mwene Yehozadaki, umuherezi mukuru.<verse eid="HAG 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAG 1:2" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: “Aba bantu bavuga bati: ‘Igihe ntikiragera co gusubira kwubaka Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.’ ”<verse eid="HAG 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAG 1:3" />Maze Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryongera kuza riciye ku wavugishwa n’Imana Hagayi riti: <verse eid="HAG 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAG 1:4" />“Mbega iki ni igihe c’uko mwebwe mwibera mu mazu yanyu asharije kandi yubatse neza, ariko Ingoro yanje yoyo ikaguma ari umusaka?”<verse eid="HAG 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAG 1:5" />None rero uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: “Nimwiyumvire neza ku nzira zanyu. <verse eid="HAG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAG 1:6" />Mwateye vyinshi, ariko mwimbuye bike. Murarya, ariko ntimwigera muhaga. Muranywa, ariko ntimwigera mushira inyota. Murambara, ariko ntimushira imbeho. Muronka imishahara mukayishira mu mifuko itobotse.”<verse eid="HAG 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAG 1:7" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: “Nimugenzure inzira zanyu. <verse eid="HAG 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAG 1:8" />Nimuduge mu misozi muzane ibiti maze mwubake Ingoro yanje, kugira ngo inezereze kandi impeshe icubahiro,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. <verse eid="HAG 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAG 1:9" />“Mwari mwiteze kwimbura vyinshi, ariko raba, mwimbuye bike. Ivyo mwashikanye mu ngo ntuma bikeha. Ni kubera iki?” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose abaza. “Ni kubera inzu yanje, yagumye ari umusaka, mu gihe umwe wese muri mwebwe yitwararitse kwubaka neza inzu yiwe. <verse eid="HAG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAG 1:10" />Nuko rero, kubera mwebwe, ikirere carabimye urume, eka n’isi yarabimye ivyimburwa. <verse eid="HAG 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAG 1:11" />Nahamagaye uruzuba ngo ruze ku mirima, ku misozi, ku ngano, ku mizabibu, ku mavuta ya elayo ku bindi vyimburwa vyose isi itanga, ku bantu no ku bitungano, no ku vyo mwaruhiye vyose.”<verse eid="HAG 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAG 1:12" />Nuko Zerubabeli mwene Sheyalutiyeli, Yosuwa mwene Yehozadaki, umuherezi mukuru, n’amasigarira yose, bumvira ijwi ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo n’ubutumwa bw’uwavugishwa n’Imana Hagayi, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo yari yamutumye. Abantu bubaha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="HAG 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAG 1:13" />Maze Hagayi, intumwa y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ashikiriza abantu ubu butumwa buvuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> buvuga ngo: “Ndi kumwe namwe,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. <verse eid="HAG 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAG 1:14" />Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> akangura umutima wa Zerubabeli mwene Sheyalutiyeli, umukuru w’intara y’i Buyuda, n’umutima wa Yosuwa mwene Yehozadaki, umuherezi mukuru, n’umutima w’amasigarira yo mu bantu. Baraza batangura kwubaka Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana yabo, <verse eid="HAG 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAG 1:15" />ku musi wa mirongo ibiri na kane w’ukwezi kugira gatandatu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HAG 1:15">Mu mwaka ugira kabiri umwami Dariyusi ari ku ngoma,<verse eid="HAG 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HAG 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ubwiza bwasezeranywe bw’Ingoro nshasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAG 2:1" />Ku musi wa mirongo ibiri na rimwe w’ukwezi kugira indwi, ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> riraza riciye mu wavugishwa n’Imana Hagayi, rivuga riti: <verse eid="HAG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAG 2:2" />“Vugana na Zerubabeli mwene Sheyalutiyeli, umukuru w’intara y’i Buyuda, na Yosuwa mwene Yehozadaki, umuherezi mukuru, n’amasigarira yose y’abo bantu. Ubabaze uti: <verse eid="HAG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAG 2:3" />‘Ni nde muri mwebwe agisigaye yoba yarabonye iyi Ngoro mu bwiza bwayo bwa kera? Mbega ubu isa gute? Mbega ntisa n’aho ari ubusa?’ <verse eid="HAG 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAG 2:4" />‘Ariko ubu rero shikama, yewe Zerubabeli,’ ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. ‘Shikama, yewe Yosuwa mwene Yehozadaki, umuherezi mukuru. Nimushikame mukomere, namwe bantu mwese muri mu gihugu,’ ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, ‘maze mukore. Kuko ndi kumwe namwe,’ ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze. <verse eid="HAG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAG 2:5" />‘Ibi ni vyo nasezeranye namwe igihe mwava muri Egiputa. Kandi Mpwemu wanje aguma hagati muri mwebwe. Ntimutinye.’<verse eid="HAG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAG 2:6" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: ‘Mu gihe gito nzosubira kunyiganyiza amajuru n’isi, ikiyaga n’i musozi.’ <verse eid="HAG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAG 2:7" />Nzonyiganyiza amahanga yose, kandi ivyo amahanga yose yipfuza bizoza, maze nzokwuzuza ubwiza iyi Ngoro, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze. <verse eid="HAG 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAG 2:8" />‘Ifeza ni izanje n’inzahabu ni izanje,’ ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze. <verse eid="HAG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAG 2:9" />‘Ubwiza bw’iyi Ngoro buzoruta ubw’iya kera,’ ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze. ‘Kandi nzozana amahoro aha hantu,’ ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.”<verse eid="HAG 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imigisha izoba ku bantu bahumanye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAG 2:10" />Ku musi wa mirongo ibiri na kane w’ukwezi kw’icenda, mu mwaka ugira kabiri Dariyusi ari ku ngoma, ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryongera kuza riciye ku wavugishwa n’Imana Hagayi riti: <verse eid="HAG 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAG 2:11" />“Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: ‘Baza abaherezi uko ivyagezwe bivuga: <verse eid="HAG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAG 2:12" />Umuntu niyatwara inyama zeguriwe Imana mu muzingo w’impuzu wiwe, maze uwo muzingo ugakora ku mukate canke imboga, umuvinyu, amavuta ya elayo canke ibindi vyokurya vyose, mbega ivyo na vyo nyene bizoca biba ivyeguriwe Imana?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HAG 2:12">Maze abaherezi barishura bati: “Oya.”<verse eid="HAG 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAG 2:13" />Maze Hagayi aravuga ati: “Umuntu yahumanijwe no gukora ku muvyimba akoze kuri kimwe muri ivyo, mbega gica gihumana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HAG 2:13">Ba baherezi barishura bati: “gica gihumana.”<verse eid="HAG 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAG 2:14" />Maze Hagayi aravuga ati: “ ‘Ni ko bimeze no kuri aba bantu no kuri iri hanga mu nyonga zanje,’ ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. ‘Ivyo bakora vyose n’ivyo bashikana vyose biranduye.’<verse eid="HAG 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAG 2:15" />None rero nimwiyumvire kuri ibi uhereye uno musi, mwibuke igihe ata buye ryari bwagerekwe ku rindi mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="HAG 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAG 2:16" />Umuntu yaja kurondera ingero mirongo ibiri mu kigega z’ingano, yasangamwo ingero cumi gusa. Uwaja kurondera ingero mirongo itanu z’umuvinyu mu bwato bwo kuganiramwo, yasangamwo ingero mirongo ibiri gusa. <verse eid="HAG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAG 2:17" />Nateje igikorwa c’amaboko yanyu kurumba, ukubora n’urubura, ariko na ho nyene ntimwangarutseko, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. <verse eid="HAG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAG 2:18" />‘Kuva uwu musi, umusi wa mirongo ibiri na kane w’ukwezi kugira icenda, mwiyumvire cane ku musi itanguriro ry’uru rusengero rw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryashirwaho. Mwiyumvire neza: <verse eid="HAG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAG 2:19" />Mbega hari n’imbuto zisigaye mu bigega? Kugeza ubu, umuzabibu, n’umusukoni, umukomamanga n’umwelayo ntivyamye ivyamwa vyavyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HAG 2:19">Uhereye kuri uwu musi nzobahezagira.’ ”<verse eid="HAG 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isezerano kuri Zerubabeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HAG 2:20" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> riraza riciye kuri Hagayi ubugira kabiri ku musi ugira mirongo ibiri na kane w’uko kwezi nyene, riti: <verse eid="HAG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HAG 2:21" />“Bwira Zerubabeli umukuru w’intara y’i Buyuda ko ngiye kunyiganyiza amajuru n’isi. <verse eid="HAG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HAG 2:22" />Nzotembagaza intebe z’ubwami nsangangure ubushobozi bw’amahanga. Nzotembagaza imikogote n’abayigenderako; amafarasi n’abayagenderako bizotemba, umwe wese yicwe n’inkota y’umuvukanyi wiwe.<verse eid="HAG 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HAG 2:23" />‘Kuri uwo musi,’ ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze, ‘nzogutwara, wewe Zerubabeli umusavyi wanje mwene Sheyalutiyeli,’ ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, ‘maze ndakugire nk’impeta yo ku rutoke rwanje, kuko nagutoranije,’ ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.”<verse eid="HAG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAG 2" />
</usx>